/* Toolbar and meter tooltips (the labels on the meter itself stay in English) */
"Reset: clear peak holds and clip latches, and restart Integrated LUFS" = "重置：清除峰值保持与削波锁存，并重新开始积分 LUFS";
"Monitor in Mono: one channel, read from the input routed to L" = "以单声道监听：一个声道，读取路由到 L 的输入";
"Monitor in Stereo: L and R lead; other channels recede" = "以立体声监听：突出 L 与 R，其他声道退后";
"Monitor in Multi Channel: every channel of %@. Change the format in Settings ▸ Channels." = "以多声道监听：%@ 的全部声道。可在“设置 ▸ 声道”中更改格式。";
"Auto: Mono when a single input is routed. Otherwise Multi Channel after 150 ms above −60 dBFS on any channel but L, R and LFE, and back to Stereo after 2.5 s of front-only programme. Silence holds the mode; LFE alone never switches it. Detected now: %@." = "自动：只路由一路输入时为单声道。否则，L、R、LFE 以外任一声道高于 −60 dBFS 持续 150 ms 即切换为多声道；只有前置声道有节目持续 2.5 秒后回到立体声。静音时保持当前模式；单独的 LFE 不会触发切换。当前检测：%@。";
"Auto mode" = "自动模式";
"Off" = "关闭";
"TARGET: the loudness standard of the current mode. The gauge, delta, history band and VU meter read against it. Stereo and Multi Channel each keep their own and follow the mode." = "TARGET：当前模式的响度标准。响度条、差值、历史目标带与 VU 表均以它为基准。立体声与多声道各自保存一套，并随模式切换。";
"CEILING: the True Peak limit of the current mode. TRUE PEAK turns amber above it." = "CEILING：当前模式的 True Peak 上限。超过时 TRUE PEAK 显示为琥珀色。";
"VU: the whole programme on one needle, the power sum of every routed channel except LFE, with standard 300 ms VU ballistics. 0 VU sits at the loudness target of the current mode (%@ dBFS)." = "VU：用一根指针显示整个节目，即除 LFE 外所有已路由声道的功率和，采用标准 300 ms VU 动态特性。0 VU 对齐当前模式的响度目标（%@ dBFS）。";
"Drag to resize · double-click to reset" = "拖移以调整大小 · 连按两次以复原";
"Dropped %d" = "丢帧 %d";

